sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client (Browser/Mobile App)
    participant DNS as DNS Resolver
    participant Server as Web/API Server

    Client->>DNS: Query IP for api.example.com
    DNS-->>Client: Return IP (e.g., 93.184.216.34)
    Note over Client,Server: TCP 3-Way Handshake (SYN -> SYN-ACK -> ACK)
    Client->>Server: HTTP Request (GET /v1/users/123 HTTP/1.1)
    Note over Client,Server: Headers: Host, User-Agent, Accept, Authorization
    Server->>Server: Process Request (Auth, Routing, DB Query)
    Server-->>Client: HTTP Response (200 OK + JSON Payload)
    Note over Client,Server: Headers: Content-Type: application/json, Cache-Control
